PN,41201
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786124905
OL,3,C'Fleadh has made Belfast feel
OL,4,Cdifferent'
OL,6,FIf I'm honest I wasn't sure what to
OL,7,Fexpect when I cajoled my hubbie and
OL,8,Fyoungest two children into the car and
OL,9,Fdown to the Fleadh for the opening
OL,10,Fceremony.
OL,12,FDespite my effusion (mostly a recent
OL,13,Frekindling of Christy Moore on
OL,14,FSpotify) my eldest boy preferred a
OL,15,Fround of golf with his friends.
OL,17,FWe got parked easily enough behind
OL,18,Fcity hall and dandered into the
OL,19,Fgrounds in good time to watch it all
OL,20,Fbegin.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/5
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
