FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786124905
OL,3,C'Fleadh has made Belfast feel
OL,4,Cdifferent'
OL,6,FThe vibe was just lovely, very relaxed
OL,7,F- and as I passed Margot with their
OL,8,Faperol spritz on tap I reminded myself
OL,9,Fit had just gone midday.
OL,11,FMy seven-year-old boy pestered me for
OL,12,Fyet another snack and I handed him a
OL,13,Fbag of hula hoops.
OL,15,FOnly then did I finally settle into
OL,16,Fthe moment.
OL,18,FThe highlight was Emily's friend from
OL,19,Fschool performing as a traditional
OL,20,FIrish dancer (no wig or fake tan).
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/5
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786124905
OL,3,C'Fleadh has made Belfast feel
OL,4,Cdifferent'
OL,6,FThen as the talented young men from
OL,7,Fthe marching bands playing their
OL,8,Fflutes and drums were welcomed on
OL,9,Fstage I began to feel quite emotional.
OL,11,FTheir distinctive sound was warmly
OL,12,Freceived and then gently merged with
OL,13,Fthe trad musicians on stage to create
OL,14,Fthe most beautiful sound.
OL,16,FWe bumped into work colleagues who
OL,17,Fwere working on our special programmes
OL,18,Fto cover what will be the biggest
OL,19,Fevent Belfast has ever hosted.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/5
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
