PN,41204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786124905
OL,3,C'Fleadh has made Belfast feel
OL,4,Cdifferent'
OL,6,FWe caught up with friends and had some
OL,7,Flunch together before other
OL,8,Fcommitments sadly hastened our exit.
OL,10,FAs the week went on and work beckoned
OL,11,FI presented from City Hall and watched
OL,12,Ffrom studio the build up to the
OL,13,Fhistoric Ulster Scots showcase where
OL,14,Fthe Taoiseach was seen getting selfies
OL,15,Fwith Rangers fans.
OL,17,FAnd then there's the economic benefit
OL,18,Fwhich is reported to be huge.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/5
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
