OL,3,C'Fleadh has made Belfast feel
OL,4,Cdifferent'
OL,6,FThe Fleadh has definitely made Belfast
OL,7,Ffeel different. It may even have
OL,8,Fchanged the face of the city forever.
OL,10,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,11,FITVX
OL,13,FSign up for our free weekly newsletter
OL,14,Fhere.
